        },
        {
          "text": "abwira Natani uwavugishwa n’Imana ati: “Ehe raba jewe mba mu nzu yubatswe n’ibiti vy’amasederi, nayo Isandugu y’Imana iba mw’ihema.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.7.2",
